* qu_lec_pin_3 -- AnalogGym topology on TSMC12 BSIM-CMG (LEVEL=72)
* Connectivity and mirror ratios are the shipped ones; geometry is re-designed for 0.8 V FinFET.
.subckt qu_lec_pin_3 gnda vdda vinn vinp vout
